    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Basic effect(s)*\n- ATK & DEF 210%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- All allies' Ki +2\n- Launches 2 additional attacks, each of which has a great chance\nof becoming a Super Attack\n- Great chance of performing a critical hit\n- Great chance of evading enemy's attack\n*When there is another \"Demonic Power\" Category ally attacking in\nthe same turn*\n- Damage reduction rate 21%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*When attacking*\n- ATK & DEF 210%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*After receiving or evading an attack*\n- Ki +2 and ATK 210%{passiveImg:up_g} for 4 turns\n*After performing 3 attacks in battle*\n- {passiveImg:once}Interrupts the attacked enemy\n- {passiveImg:once}Damage reduction rate 21%{passiveImg:up_g} within the turn\n*After performing 6 attacks in battle*\n- {passiveImg:once}Interrupts the attacked enemy\n- {passiveImg:once}Chance of evading enemy's attack 21%{passiveImg:up_g} within the turn",
